SUMMARY:2026 Class Reunions! (Classes of 2001 & 2016)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the reunions of the Classes of 1976 (50-year)\, 2
 001 (25-year)\, and 2016 (10-year). Come back to Bloomington to reconnect
  with classmates\, revisit the halls of the Law School\, and enjoy a day 
 of special programming.Schedule of Events2:00–3:30 p.m. — IU Stadium 
 Tour  4:00–5:00 p.m. — Faculty Panel (Room 125)  5:00–7:00 p.m. —
  Reunion Reception (Reading Room)    Hors d'oeuvres and drinks will be pr
 ovided during the reception\, and student-guided tours of the Law School 
 will also be available throughout the evening.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p class="isSelectedEnd">  Join us for the r
 eunions of the Classes of 1976 (50-year)\, 2001 (25-year)\, and 2016 (10-
 year). Come back to Bloomington to reconnect with classmates\, revisit th
 e halls of the Law School\, and enjoy a day of special programming.</p><p
  class="isSelectedEnd"><strong>Schedule of Events</strong></p><ul data-sp
 read="false"><li><strong>2:00–3:30 p.m.</strong> — IU Stadium Tour  <
 /li><li><strong>4:00–5:00 p.m.</strong> — Faculty Panel (Room 125)  <
 /li><li><strong>5:00–7:00 p.m.</strong> — Reunion Reception (Reading 
 Room)  </li></ul><p>  Hors d'oeuvres and drinks will be provided during t
 he reception\, and student-guided tours of the Law School will also be av
 ailable throughout the evening.</p>
