SUMMARY:Chips with ChIPs: Wellness & Walk
DESCRIPTION:Join Chiefs in Intellectual Property (ChIPs) for a causal\, f
 un wellness week event. We will gather in the law school lobby at 12pm an
 d then take a short walk over to Dunn Meadows for a picnic outside. ChIPs
  will provide chips for the event\, but please plan to bring your own lun
 ch and blanket/towel/chair to sit on!  We kindly request that participant
 s avoid bringing peanuts due to potential airborne peanut allergies. If y
 ou are interested in attending and have an airborne allergy\, please let 
 us know and we can update our information to include that food item.  RSV
 P by October 4th at noon.&#160\;
