 chool lobby at 12pm and then take a short walk over to Dunn Meadows for a
  picnic outside. ChIPs will provide chips for the event\, but please plan
  to bring your own lunch and blanket/towel/chair to sit on!<br /><br />  
 We kindly request that participants avoid bringing peanuts due to potenti
 al airborne peanut allergies. If you are interested in attending and have
  an airborne allergy\, please let us know and we can update our informati
