DESCRIPTION:Join the Maurer Health Law Society for an insightful panel di
 scussion on navigating careers in a rapidly evolving field! Hear firsthan
 d perspectives and personal career journeys from:Perry Woo – Patent Cou
 nsel\, Eli Lilly  Hannah Clark '22 – Associate\, Antitrust &amp\; Healt
 h Economics\, Hall Render  Prof. Jennifer D. Oliva – Maurer School of L
 aw    Whether you are interested in intellectual property\, patent prosec
 ution\, antitrust\, business law\, or data privacy\, this panel offers re
 levant insights into how these fields intersect within the health law lan
 dscape.  RSVP by noon on October 5th.&#160\;
