 tober 6\, 8 and 9\, followed by a full timed mock LSAT on Saturday\, Octo
 ber 10\, and then a review session to cover frequently missed diagnostic 
 questions. Led by Lawgic Prep co-founder Zach Goldberg (172 LSAT)\, the s
