SUMMARY:Trick or Treat at Maurer
DESCRIPTION:Trick or Treat at Maurer is an event that brings together sta
 ff\, faculty\, and students with children to celebrate Halloween. Differe
 nt departments in the law school will decorate and have candy available f
 or the children that attend. This event will be hosted by OWLS and OLL.  
 To participate\, please RSVP below by October 27 with your name and the n
